WEBVTT

1
00:00:06.734 --> 00:00:11.044
Last fall, I had my first sleepover.

2
00:00:11.045 --> 00:00:14.289
I slept over at my friend Steve's house.

3
00:00:14.290 --> 00:00:17.515
It was so much fun!

4
00:00:17.516 --> 00:00:20.468
"Jim, here is your sleeping bag.

5
00:00:20.469 --> 00:00:23.436
Have fun!" said Mom.

6
00:00:23.437 --> 00:00:27.359
"See you tomorrow, Mom," I said.

7
00:00:27.360 --> 00:00:31.727
When I arrived at Steve's house, Steve said hello.

8
00:00:31.728 --> 00:00:35.648
"Hi, Jim! Let's go outside to rollerblade."

9
00:00:35.649 --> 00:00:40.678
"Okay, let's go," I said.

10
00:00:40.679 --> 00:00:44.869
"Hey! Watch me turn around!" said Steve.

11
00:00:44.870 --> 00:00:49.194
"Yeah! Watch me jump!" I said.

12
00:00:49.195 --> 00:00:53.048
Later, Steve's mom called us into the house.

13
00:00:53.049 --> 00:00:56.196
"Come in! Time to eat pizza!"

14
00:00:56.197 --> 00:01:00.449
"This is really yummy!" we said.

15
00:01:00.450 --> 00:01:04.618
After we ate pizza, we played a computer game.

16
00:01:04.619 --> 00:01:09.580
"Come on! Come on!" we yelled.

17
00:01:09.581 --> 00:01:11.628
Then we went to bed.

18
00:01:11.629 --> 00:01:14.708
Steve's mom turned off the lights.

19
00:01:14.709 --> 00:01:16.768
"Don't stay up and talk.

20
00:01:16.769 --> 00:01:21.535
You will be tired tomorrow. Good night!"

21
00:01:21.536 --> 00:01:25.954
"Good night!" we said, but we couldn't sleep.

22
00:01:25.955 --> 00:01:31.141
We giggled and giggled, and giggled again!

23
00:01:31.142 --> 00:01:33.843
Steve's mom came back.

24
00:01:33.844 --> 00:01:38.836
"Shh! This time, go to sleep! Good night!"

25
00:01:38.837 --> 00:01:44.615
"Okay, good night!" we said.

26
00:01:44.616 --> 00:01:47.456
We felt very tired!

27
00:01:47.457 --> 00:01:52.388
Suddenly, we heard a strange sound from the closet!

28
00:01:52.389 --> 00:01:56.302
"What was that?" we gasped.

29
00:01:56.303 --> 00:01:57.975
We were scared.

30
00:01:57.976 --> 00:02:00.848
We heard the sound again!

31
00:02:00.849 --> 00:02:07.223
"Ooh! There might be a monster in the closet!" I said.

32
00:02:07.224 --> 00:02:11.894
"Oh no!" Steve pulled his blanket over his head.

33
00:02:11.895 --> 00:02:16.258
I pulled my blanket over my head too.

34
00:02:16.259 --> 00:02:20.332
"Did you hear that sound again?" I asked.

35
00:02:20.333 --> 00:02:26.079
"I'm scared! I want my mommy!" said Steve.

36
00:02:26.080 --> 00:02:28.558
He did not want to look!

37
00:02:28.559 --> 00:02:31.431
Soon, it was quiet again.

38
00:02:31.432 --> 00:02:35.701
So I peeked out from under the covers.

39
00:02:35.702 --> 00:02:40.550
"Guess what? It's just your guinea pig!"

40
00:02:40.551 --> 00:02:44.042
It was out of its cage.

41
00:02:44.043 --> 00:02:45.966
We both laughed!

42
00:02:45.967 --> 00:02:58.679
But soon, we both were snoring.

43
00:02:58.680 --> 00:03:02.567
The next morning, my mom came to pick me up.

44
00:03:02.568 --> 00:03:05.625
"Was it fun?" she asked.

45
00:03:05.626 --> 00:03:07.863
"Terrific!" I said.

46
00:03:07.864 --> 00:03:12.676
"Mom, can Steve sleep over at our house next weekend?"

47
00:03:12.677 --> 00:03:15.838
"Yes, he can," Mom agreed.

48
00:03:15.839 --> 00:03:21.090
"Thank you!" I said.
